    <x:String x:Key="Loc.P.ContextMenu.CC3">Right-click to select an action. The selected action will be displayed.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Loc.P.ContextMenu.CC4">Declarative markup that attaches a ContextMenu to an element via ContextMenuService.</x:String>
