    <x:String x:Key="Loc.P.Dialogs.CC4">Open icon picking, Open With, and file properties sheets backed directly by Win32 shell APIs.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Loc.P.Dialogs.CT4">Shell Dialogs</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Loc.P.Dialogs.CC5">Allows users to select a font family, style, and size.</x:String>
