    <x:String x:Key="Loc.P.Dialogs.CC9">ViewModel commands call an injected dialog service; code-behind remains empty.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Loc.P.Dialogs.Body1">The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Loc.P.Dialogs.Body2">These examples use Jalium.UI.Controls.MessageBox so the sample window stays the owner while you test classic system prompts.</x:String>
