    <x:String x:Key="Loc.P.Ribbon.CT3">Ribbon Components</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Loc.P.Ribbon.CC4">Declarative markup that assembles the ribbon, its tabs and its groups.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Loc.P.Ribbon.CC5">Reading ribbon properties and wiring commands from code-behind.</x:String>
