    <x:String x:Key="Loc.P.Splitter.CT2">Vertical Splitter</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Loc.P.Splitter.CC3">Combine several splitters — a sidebar plus a stacked content and console — for an IDE-style workspace.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Loc.P.Splitter.CT3">Multi-Panel Layout</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Loc.P.Splitter.CC4">Splitters power the resizable layouts found across everyday desktop apps.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Loc.P.Splitter.CC5">Declarative markup for the splitter layouts above.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Loc.P.Splitter.CC6">Building a resizable IDE-style layout with GridSplitters in code-behind.</x:String>
