    <x:String x:Key="Loc.P.XamlUICommand.CC3">Binding ViewModel-owned XamlUICommand instances to a command bar and registering their keyboard shortcuts.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Loc.P.XamlUICommand.CC4">Command definitions and execution live in independent ViewModels.</x:String>

